  "privacyScopeBody": "We collect only what's needed to build your therapeutic meal plan: your vital measurements (weight, body circumference), your daily meal logs, your diagnosed health conditions, your food allergies, and the medications and supplements you tell us about. We never request or store financial data or permanent location data.",
